 does not exist in <Picture 1> is forbidden.\n<Subject 3> is the T-shaped catwalk stage and fashion-show environment shown in <Picture 2> — the stage structure, lighting, and audience atmosphere come from <Picture 2>, and the model will walk on the stage of <Subject 3>.\n\nsummary:\n[reference generation] The target video is a luxury fashion-show clip: the fashion model from <Subject 1>, wearing the outfit of <Subject 2>, walks down the T-shaped catwalk of <Subject 3> toward the audience, pauses at the foot of the runway, leans slightly left and right, then turns 180 degrees to face the direction she came from and walks back along the same path to the point where she started. <Picture 1> is the sole source for the model and the outfit; <Picture 2> is the sole source for the stage environment.\n\nretention_analysis:\n<Subject 1> (appears throughout [Shot 1]): fully_preserved - the model's face, hairstyle, expression, and body match <Picture 1> exactly, unchanged for the entire video.\n<Subject 2> (appears throughout [Shot 1]): fully_preserved - the outfit matches <Picture 1> exactly: the same top, bottoms, shoes, and accessories, with the same colors, cut, and fabric. No clothing that does not exist in <Picture 1> may appear anywhere in the video, and no alteration is allowed.\n<Subject 3> (appears in [Shot 1]): fully_preserved - the stage, lighting, and audience atmosphere match <Picture 2> exactly, unchanged for the entire video.\n\ndetailed_description:\nThe target video is in a luxury fashion-editorial style with bright stage lighting and a stylish runway atmosphere.\n[Shot 1] <Subject 1>, wearing the outfit of <Subject 2> (the exact same ensemble as in <Picture 1>), walks down the runway stem of the T-shaped catwalk stage of <Subject 3> toward the camera. Her face and hairstyle are exactly as in <Picture 1>, unchanged throughout; her complete outfit remains identical to <Picture 1> while walking and turning, with no clothing added or changed. She strides with perfect posture and poise, full of charm and confidence, the outfit flowing naturally with each step. She pauses at the foot of the runway, the tip closest to the audience, and leans her torso slightly left then right, letting the outfit catch the light. She then turns 180 degrees to face the direction she came from and walks back along the same path to the point where she started, the camera turning with her so her face and outfit remain visible the whole time. The whole shot is one continuous take with no cuts.\n\noverall_soundscape: The rhythmic click of high heels on the polished catwalk floor, the soft swish of fabric with each step and turn, and a subtle crowd ambiance with scattered applause in the background.\n\nnon_diegetic_music: A stylish fashion-show score with a driving electronic beat at a moderate tempo, swelling gently as she stops at the foot of the runway and settling as she walks back.",800,1120,209,"max"]},{"id":8,"type":"BasicScheduler","pos":[293.01757825898727,279.9744917387115],"size":[300.799999649807,132.847554147888],"flags":{},"order":17,"mode":0,"inputs":[{"localized_name":"model","name":"model","type":"MODEL","link":24},{"localized_name":"scheduler","name":"scheduler","type":"COMBO","widget":{"name":"scheduler"},"link":null},{"localized_name":"steps","name":"steps","type":"INT","widget":{"name":"steps"},"link":null},{"localized_name":"denoise","name":"denoise","type":"FLOAT","widget":{"name":"denoise"},"link":null}],"outputs":[{"localized_name":"SIGMAS","name":"SIGMAS","type":"SIGMAS","links":[11]}],"properties":{"cnr_id":"comfy-core","ver":"0.30.0","Node name for S&R":"BasicScheduler"},"widgets_values":["beta",10,1]},{"id":64,"type":"LoadImage","pos":[-1894.4615320829005,128.9049649831007],"size":[282.798828125,314],"flags":{},"order":13,"mode":0,"inputs":[{"localized_name":"image","name":"image","type":"COMBO","widget":{"name":"image"},"link":null},{"localized_name":"choose file to upload","name":"upload","type":"IMAGEUPLOAD","widget":{